# Beats — the Chatters

# A recruiter offers a live choice: the participant decides on their phone.
== recruit(guest)
  cast: Recruiter, guest
  RECRUITER
    The Chatters could use you. What do you say?
  * Join the Chatters
    <join: guest to Chatters>
  * Stay loyal
    <set: guest.score += 10>

# Verified_Vera reacts differently to each faction (a `<match:>` on the
# guest's allegiance), then puts everyone on the feed regardless.
== verified_meet(guest)
  cast: Verified_Vera, guest
  VERIFIED_VERA
    <match: guest.faction>
      Chatters
        One of mine! Let's get you some clout.
        <set: guest.karma += 15>
        <set: guest.verified = true>
      Mods
        A Mod, slumming it with the famous. Bold of you.
        <set: guest.karma += 5>
      TheAlgorithm
        ...have we met? Your eyes flicker like a loading screen.
    Either way — chin up, you're on the feed now.
    <broadcast: spotlight to participant(guest)>
